Project Demonstration Phase
During the demonstration, the FitBuddy application can be presented step by step.
First, the FitBuddy home page is opened.
The user's name, user ID, age and weight are entered.
The user then selects a fitness goal, fitness level and workout intensity.
The available workout time is entered.
The Generate My Plan button is clicked.
The application sends the information to Gemini.
Gemini generates a personalized 7-day fitness plan.
The generated plan is displayed with daily exercises, warm-up, activity, sets or duration, rest, cool-down and notes.
The application also displays general nutrition and recovery suggestions.
Next, feedback can be entered by the user.
The feedback is sent to Gemini, and the system generates an updated workout plan.
Finally, the admin section can be demonstrated to show the stored users and fitness plans.
